# 🧭 10. Security Incident Response Workflow

```text
Detect or Receive Report
          ↓
Gather Essential Information
          ↓
Assess Potential Risk
          ↓
Report and Escalate
          ↓
Contain Using Approved Procedures
          ↓
Investigate and Remediate
          ↓
Verify Security and Recovery
          ↓
Document and Close When Authorized
```

### Key Principle

**Report promptly, preserve evidence, follow approved procedures, and do not claim an incident is resolved until the appropriate verification is complete.**

